      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I have a clear picture of what needs improvement. The original test has several understandability issues:\n1. Many unused imports\n2. Unused `data_valid` / `data_invalid` helper methods\n3. Cryptic variable name `test12`\n4. No assertion messages explaining each case\n5. No `@DisplayName` to describe the test intent\n\nLet me write the improved version.Now I'll compile-check the generated test.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored file removes all unused imports and helper methods, renames `test12` to the descriptive `twelveSeconds`, adds a `@DisplayName` annotation explaining the integer-division contract, and attaches an inline message to each assertion to make the expected truncation behaviour immediately clear."
